# Deployment repo: Delhi AQI Prediction
# This repo is meant to be its own self-contained project, not a subtree of a
# user home directory. Exclude anything outside this project folder so nothing
# from the enclosing machine environment is ever staged or pushed.

# If this folder was previously untracked inside a parent repo, the parent may
# still try to absorb sibling paths. The entries below keep the project repo
# self-contained by ignoring any such sibling-level artifacts relative to this
# project root. These paths are expressed relative to this project folder, so
# they quietly match nothing on a clean checkout and are only active where
# relevant.
../
..?/
../.*
../*

# Concrete local exclusions intended for this project
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
app/static/ui/
app/cache/weather_cache.json
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
